# Design tokens

SoT values: `modules/projects/veela.css/src/scss/core/misc/_tokens.scss` (`@layer tokens` on `:root, :host, :scope`).
Layer order SoT: `modules/projects/veela.css/src/scss/_layers.scss`.
UI chrome SoT: `modules/projects/veela.css/src/scss/ui/` (fl.ui `src/styles/ui` is a symlink).
fl.ui `src/styles/ui/_variables.scss` is standalone alias fallback only.

## Emit vs consume

- New defaults go in the SoT file. Components, shells, and apps do not open a second `:root` palette.
- Never set `--color-*` / `--space-*` / `--radius-*` in unlayered `:root` — that beats `@layer tokens`. Standalone fallbacks stay inside `@layer tokens` and use the same seed (`#5a9ec8`). Capacitor may override the seed from Material You; Neutralino Appearance may set `appearance.color`.
- Context overrides (`[data-theme]`, host, shadow) and `var(--token, fallback)` at use sites are allowed.
- `--u2-color-mod` lives in the SoT; duplicate the function only in the fl.ui fallback file.
- Prefer `--color-*`, `--space-*`, `--radius-*`, `--text-*`, `--transition-*`, `--ui-*`.

## Alias, do not fork

| Role | Canonical | Compat alias |
|---|---|---|
| Type | `--text-*` | `--font-*`, `--font-size-*` |
| Motion | `--transition-*` | `--motion-*`, `--duration-*` |
| Box | `--space-*` | `--padding-*`, `--gap-*` |
| Icon | `--ui-icon-*` | `--icon-size-*` on host only |
| Surface | `--color-surface` | `--surface-color`, `--fl-surface`, `--wf-md-surface` |

❌ `--color-primary: #3794ff` in a component. ✅ `var(--color-primary)`.
❌ A second `@layer tokens, base, …` prelude. ✅ `@use` the SoT layers file.
❌ Edit symlink / `fest/` / `shared/` / `styles/{lib,runtime}` mirrors. ✅ Edit the real package file.

## Android 17 lean

SoT only: M3 Expressive shape (`--shape-*` aliases), 48dp `--touch-min`, `--state-opacity-*`, `--ease-emphasized` / `--ease-expressive`. Do not invent per-component radii.

`lib/veela.mdc` is conceptual. Do not copy numeric scales from it.
